# Default-deny: the image is PUBLIC on Docker Hub, so only what the app needs at
# runtime goes in. Anything else in the repo — interviews, question files, notes,
# the bio, .env — stays out unless it's explicitly allowed below.
# The bio and secrets are injected at runtime (K8s Secret volume + env).
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!server.js
!lib
!public

# Re-exclude OS noise inside the allowed directories (later rules win).
**/.DS_Store
